WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.246
One problem

00:00:01.352 --> 00:00:02.319
solved in many

00:00:02.131 --> 00:00:03.392
programming styles

00:00:03.918 --> 00:00:05.698
Cristina Videira Lopes

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:06.783
wrote Exercises in

00:00:06.595 --> 00:00:07.750
Programming Style

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:09.189
solving one problem

00:00:09.307 --> 00:00:10.781
finding word frequencies

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:11.347
in a text

00:00:11.241 --> 00:00:12.219
