00:00:26.303 --> 00:00:27.317
styles to show

00:00:27.129 --> 00:00:28.225
why functions make

00:00:28.037 --> 00:00:29.228
programs easier to

00:00:29.051 --> 00:00:30.301
read and debug

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:31.836
Full story on

00:00:31.647 --> 00:00:32.543
the dashboard
